WEBVTT

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:21.440
Nee-nee, are you pretending 
to be a Jizou statue?

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:23.000
Can I play, too?

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:26.170
No, I wasn't pretending 
to be a Jizou statue.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:28.900
I was just checking the calendar.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:33.440
Wait, Ren-chon, did you 
forget what tomorrow is?

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.160
Tomorrow is Wednesday.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.000
Yeah, but...

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:40.360
See this mark on tomorrow's date?

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:43.010
You've been looking forward to it for ages.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:45.520
Think! What's tomorrow?

00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:58.830
It's Wednesday.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:02.830
Yes... Yes, it is, 
but that's not what I mean.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:05.780
Tomorrow's when we're going camping!

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:12.830
That's right! I forgot! 
We're going camping with everyone!

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:16.350
Nee-nee, we gotta get ready! 
We gotta get ready to camp!

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:18.500
Hurry! Hurry!

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:21.900
Actually, I already have everything ready.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:24.980
Is there anything special 
you want to prepare?

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:26.800
My heart and mind!

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:29.980
You'll have to do that yourself.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:52.500
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:03.530
<b>Episode 6</b>

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:03.530
<b>We All Went Camping Together</b>

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.520
The campground! It's the campground!

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:33.140
Over here? Is this where 
we put up the tent?

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.730
That's right.

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:39.840
Okay, can you all help pitch the tent?

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:40.890
Sure!

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:45.190
And Nii-chan, when we're done, you can 
pitch your own tent next to ours.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:07.410
Ren-chon, Ren-chon.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.710
Come over here and help us out.

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:11.850
I'll help! I'll help!

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:14.240
What should I do?

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:17.510
Well, can you stick the peg in here?

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:18.270
Peg?

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.910
The things we tie the tent 
to so it won't blow away.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:23.400
We pound them into the 
ground with a hammer.

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:25.660
These are called pegs?

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.730
Yep.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:30.240
Hmm...

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:51.130
You two! Stop playing around and help us!

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:09.710
The tent is done!

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.330
I'm going in first!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.450
I wanna see the inside, too!

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.860
You two can go in and play, too.

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:18.590
Okay!

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:20.380
Greatman Punch!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.440
Punch!

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:23.380
Greatman Kick!

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:23.840
Hey, don't get too crazy! Let's go!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:24.390
Kick!

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:27.540
We'll have a barbecue around sundown.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.010
Okay, now...

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:13.260
Let's eat!

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.230
It's delicious!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:23.310
Yeah!

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.520
It's so good!

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.420
I'm stuffed.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:47.300
Kazu-nee, should we toss the 
paper plates in this bag?

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:51.360
I dunno... I drank too much an' now...

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.100
Uh, the bag...

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:58.950
Hiyah! Mosquito.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:03.990
She's so drunk, she's attracting mosquitoes.

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:08.240
We shouldn't leave her like this. 
Let's carry her into the tent.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.950
Y-Yeah, we should.

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:13.840
Nattsun, Nattsun. What are 
we gonna play tomorrow?

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:16.620
What? You're going to bed already?

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:21.290
I was gonna catch rhinoceros beetles 
with this brown sugar syrup.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.090
You really want to sleep?

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:24.800
Rh-Rhino...!

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:28.080
I-I'm not going to bed yet! 
Let's go catch some now!

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:31.420
Now, just hang on. It's still too early.

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:36.190
So let's play cards in the tent for now! 
Are you ready, Ren-chon?

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:37.900
Ready!

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:41.580
All right! The Ren-chon Tent Charge!

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:42.340
Yeah!

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:48.610
Kazu-nee's in the way.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:56.030
<b>Yo No Ri
N Bi N No</b>

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.300
And I'm out!

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:03.220
Aw, I lost!

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:05.360
So what should we play next?

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:07.910
Let's see... How about sevens?

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:09.500
Hey, Nattsun.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:12.630
Aren't we gonna go put out 
that syrup for the beetles?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:15.570
Oh, I forgot. Ready to go, Ren-chon?

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:17.740
What? Right now?

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:19.870
Why didn't you do that earlier?

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:23.690
Nattsun said right after 
dinnertime was too soon.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.460
Yeah, that was a lie.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.600
What?! Why did you lie about that?!

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:30.740
I just didn't want to move 
because I was too full.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:34.110
But walking at night will 
be fun! Like an adventure!

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:37.670
You say that now, but you'll get 
scared and come right back.

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:39.610
Please. I'm not you.

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:42.810
Uh... B-But it's nighttime.

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:45.360
Shouldn't we take Sensei with us?

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:48.110
What? Kazu-nee's passed out drunk.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:51.390
Hey, it'll be fine. 
We'll be back in no time.

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:53.430
So let's get going!

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:57.880
Rhino, rhino, rhinoceros, 
rhinoceros beetles...

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:02.190
Big, shiny rhinoceros beetles...

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:02.730
So... what should we do? Play sevens?

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:07.220
I guess so. She said they'd be 
back soon, so why don't we wait?

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:10.510
Agreed. Maybe I'll go 
buy some drinks first.

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:12.430
Oh, I'll go with you.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:16.170
I guess I fell asleep...

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:17.780
Oh, Kazu-nee, you're awake.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:20.270
Hey, where's Ren-ryon?

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:24.410
Oh, she went with Natsumi-senpai to put 
out brown sugar syrup for beetles.

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:25.810
Huh?

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:29.730
That's dangerous for two kids. 
I'll go check on them.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:34.880
Um, but... are you okay? 
You seem pretty drunk...

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:37.670
I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:40.300
This is nothing! No problem!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:50.640
It's... not a good idea to 
be too loud, though...

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.860
But I'm fine, see?

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:54.810
If that's a bad idea, 
you're not fine at all!

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:58.110
Well, guess I'm goin' on a little journey.

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:02.280
No, don't go on a journey! Just find them!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:07.560
Huh? I can't get out of the tent...

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.700
Kazu-nee, the door's over here! 
You're gonna tear down the tent!

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:16.740
I'm kinda... wobbly...

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:20.860
Yeah, can't. Break time.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:26.860
Hey, it'll be easier to move like this.

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:30.460
I'll look for the girls this way.

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:37.780
I hear so many bugs.

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:39.520
I think they're katydids.

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:42.980
So, Nattsun, which tree 
do we put the syrup on?

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:46.930
Good question. We don't want 
to wander out too far.

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:49.490
Hey, Ren-ryon!

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:57.680
I heard a weird noise.

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:59.350
Probably a bug, right?

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:02.340
Come on, Ren-chon. I'll leave you here.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.970
Ren-chon!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:04.810
Coming!

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:08.820
Where are ya?

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:10.220
There you are!

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.590
Wait! Wait up! Ren-ryon!

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:18.930
Wait!

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:22.130
Wh-What happened, Ren-chon?!

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:24.470
S-Something grabbed my leg!

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:26.000
There! Over there!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:28.190
What? Where?!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.730
There's no one there.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:33.720
You probably tripped on a 
tree root or something.

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:37.090
Look, if anything shows up, 
I'll take care of it.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.800
Hey, let's use that tree.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:43.530
We'll put the syrup in that hollow spot.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.700
You can spread it on.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:46.750
Okay.

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:51.420
It's stuck. The syrup won't come out.

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:53.730
Really? We'll just take the lid off.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:58.820
Hey, Ren-ryon...

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:00.380
Can you reach, Ren-chon?

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:01.720
It's a little too high.

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.140
Want me to pick you up?

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:06.500
Ren-ryon, can't you hear me?

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:09.850
Whoops. My hair tie's stuck on a branch.

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:12.080
I'll just take it out.

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:16.640
I hear something.

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:25.770
You finally noticed me...

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.330
There really was a ghost!

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:37.790
W-W-We're in trouble! It's really real!

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:41.190
Whatever! Just run, Ren-chon!

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.470
And I'm out.

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:45.180
Aw, I lost.

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.780
Want to play sevens now?

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.230
Good idea.

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:51.510
It's out there!

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:54.690
What? Did something happen?

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.580
Th-There was a long-haired ghost!

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:59.150
What?! A gho—

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:02.790
Um, I think that might have been Sensei...

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:03.760
Huh?

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:08.230
Well, she went out looking 
for you two not long ago...

00:13:08.230 --> 00:13:12.220
Wh-What, you thought Kazu-nee was a ghost?

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:15.980
Natsumi, there's no such 
thing as ghosts, you know.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.700
Never thought I'd hear that from you...

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:23.640
Hey, everyone...

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:26.000
There's Kazu-nee now.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:28.450
Jeez, Kazu-nee!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.950
You scared Natsumi and Renge.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.060
What are you—

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:51.010
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:13:53.060 --> 00:14:00.770
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:01.990
Man...

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:04.210
It's summer vacation, you know.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:06.980
Summer vacation! Get it?

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:09.200
You're really pushing the 
"summer vacation" thing.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:12.820
Well, sure I am. It's summer vacation.

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:17.250
Anyway, Natsumi-kun, do you 
know what "vacation" means?

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.110
English, right?

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:21.120
Yeah, since I was talking 
about summer vacation,

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.470
of course that's "vacation" in English.

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:28.360
The word may have a sweet ring 
to it, but there's one problem.

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:32.190
And you seem to have the 
same problem yourself.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.250
Right.

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:36.440
That's what I came here to 
talk to you about today.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:45.400
<b>Japanese</b>

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.400
There's way too much summer homework!

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:48.390
What do they expect us 
to do with all this?!

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:50.790
Have paper as our main diet 
with grilled salmon?!

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:51.650
Yeah, exactly!

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:53.610
Summer vacation, my foot!

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:57.620
This is making my face look more 
blue than the midsummer sky!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.620
Exactly!

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:04.090
And I got more than everyone else just 
'cause my grades were a little low!

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:06.040
Seriously?! That sucks!

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:08.410
What horrible teacher would do that?!

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:09.930
I wanna see them right now!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:13.180
Hey, you two. I brought some juice.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.210
Yep! There's the teacher!

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:17.190
What? What's going on?

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:18.620
Listen, Kazu-nee!

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:19.790
I have so much summer homework,

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:23.190
I might have to camp out with 
Hika-nee to get it done!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:28.450
Oh? Well, you do love camping, Natsumi.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.360
How convenient.

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:40.800
Gotcha.

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:51.720
What is this? My mood just dropped 
so low, it's actually better.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.340
What is this feeling?

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:54.810
That's hatred.

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:58.770
Darn that Kazu-nee, acting 
like it's not her problem...

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.020
Right! I've got a good idea!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:05.980
Hika-nee, why don't we boycott this 
homework and just refuse to do it?!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:08.790
Huh? What the heck are you saying?

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.760
If we just let them have their way with us,

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.950
they might just give us even 
more homework from now on!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:16.570
We have to prevent that, whatever it takes!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:17.810
U-Uh...

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:20.700
That's your homework in that bag, right?

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.610
Weren't we gonna do this together?

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:25.930
That was the plan, but I 
can't take it any longer!

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.000
Okay! Now that that's settled,

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.080
let's ditch this homework 
and play 'til we drop!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:32.690
Whoa, whoa, whoa... Wait a minute!

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:36.400
That might work for you since your 
school has so few students,

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:39.070
but my school has a lot of students!

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:41.680
It's not a protest if I'm doing it alone!

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:46.430
Plus, if I don't do this homework 
now, I'll never finish it in time!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:49.520
Yeah? Same goes for me.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:52.590
But we're boycotting it, so we 
don't need to finish it in time.

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:53.830
<i>I'm</i> not, you idiot!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:59.070
Anyway! There's no way I'm boycotting 
anything! Understand?!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.290
<b>We Refuse!</b>

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:04.720
Yes! I win!

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:06.750
Darn, I lost.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:11.020
Man, once I gave up on that homework, 
the rest came instantly.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:14.090
I feel so liberated right now.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.010
Okay, what should we do next?

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:20.340
You know, Hika-nee... aren't card 
games boring with just two players?

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:22.360
Huh? What should we do, then?

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:24.180
Play George Washington.

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:30.420
Hey, Washington, 
what'd you eat yesterday?

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:31.230
Just stop.

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:44.170
You just thought, "I might as well 
have done my homework," didn't you?

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:46.930
Huh? What do you mean? 
I'm not thinking that.

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:50.130
You don't have to worry about 
that. We're boycotting.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:54.360
Summer vacation's almost over and 
you haven't even touched it,

00:17:54.360 --> 00:17:56.580
so it's not going to get done anyway.

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:58.320
Y-Yeah, I guess...

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:01.640
Okay, let's play video games 
in the living room, then.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.760
Yeah, good idea!

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:16.440
This is... pretty tense, isn't it?

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:17.480
Yeah.

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:20.970
Not studying and playing games right
in front of my little sister and your teacher.

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:23.120
It feels so immoral.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:26.220
Just come out and say we're boycotting.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:28.600
We didn't need to take off the headbands.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:31.370
Uh... I don't think I'm ready for that...

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:33.320
What are you talking about? Just say it!

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:35.010
Say it!

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:37.260
Cut it out!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.550
Say it!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:40.700
Cut it out!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.870
Say it!

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:45.320
<i>What are they doing? It's like a 
failed attempt at girl talk...</i>

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.580
I finished my homework.

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:50.740
Oh, good job, Ren-chon.

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.270
You sure worked hard.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.240
I'm gonna go play now.

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:58.160
Are you two done with your homework, Hika-nee?

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:02.720
Y-Yeah, of course I did my 
homework! Why wouldn't I?

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:04.710
Then I wanna play, too!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:05.690
S-Sure...

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:08.950
Oh, I'm gonna go to the bathroom.

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:10.410
You can take over for me.

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:15.220
Hika-nee, you won't beat me!

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:17.830
W-Well, I'm not gonna lose!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.510
Natsumi's taking a while.

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:36.780
I'm gonna go check on her.

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:37.850
'Kay.

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:42.070
Jeez, where did she go?

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:45.060
Huh? She's not in here.

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:46.250
The door's even open.

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:48.660
Hey, Natsumi!

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.100
You in here?

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:52.930
Hey, Natsumi!

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:55.160
What are y—

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.810
Who said you could get started before me?!

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.400
Let me go, Hika-nee!

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:08.760
I'm seriously not gonna finish in time!

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:11.140
Excuse me?! It was your idea, you know!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:14.120
I couldn't take the pressure! Forgive me!

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:17.770
No chance! Not after all 
you put me through!

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:30.460
My... homework...

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:33.920
Oh, uh... yeah...

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:36.960
Natsumi...

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:41.980
What do you say we boycott that boycott?

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:54.570
Ren-chon! Get me a towel and a 
hair dryer to dry my textbook!

00:20:54.570 --> 00:20:57.060
And get us a late-night 
snack while there's time!

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:14.040
<b>New Semester</b>

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:50.580
We Refuse

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:04.840
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:13.630
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:34.270
Dumpling?!

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:36.150
I was catching crabs.

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:38.030
It wasn't! It wasn't a dream!

00:23:38.030 --> 00:23:40.150
It's the Merlion!

00:23:40.150 --> 00:23:44.730
Just cut off my head and 
ring the gong right now.

00:23:47.020 --> 00:23:51.020
<b>Next Time 
Episode 7</b>

00:23:47.020 --> 00:23:51.020
<b>It Was a Thrilling Autumn</b>

00:23:51.020 --> 00:23:54.410
Photo: Karuku

00:23:51.020 --> 00:23:54.410
<b>Please Watch Again</b>

00:23:51.020 --> 00:23:54.410
<b>Nonstop</b>
